    ob3_h: "What is collected and who sees it",
    ob3_b: ["The text or photo you send is read by the FAHAM server in memory only. It is not stored.","Personal details are hidden first: IC, phone, account, email, address, car plate and names. This is best effort, so some may be missed.","The explanation text may be sent to ILMU (a Malaysian AI service) to write the explanation and make the voice. The Tamil voice runs in your browser.","No ads, no analytics, no tracking cookies."],
